{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_6_aggregation_ordered_set_mode_and_booleans_mode", "label": "mode()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/postgresql/pages/phase-6-aggregation/ordered-set/mode-and-booleans.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On a tie, returns the first value in the WITHIN GROUP sort order with no indication of the tie. Four kinds tied at 125000; reversing ORDER BY changed click to view. Ignores NULLs; empty input is NULL."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_6_aggregation_ordered_set_mode_and_booleans_bool_and", "label": "bool_and / every()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/postgresql/pages/phase-6-aggregation/ordered-set/mode-and-booleans.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "every() is a standard-SQL alias. Empty set is NULL not true \u2014 vacuous truth is not what SQL returns. coalesce(bool_and(...), true) or a customer with no orders is reported unpaid because NULL is falsy."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_6_aggregation_ordered_set_mode_and_booleans_hypothetical_set", "label": "Hypothetical-set aggregates", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/postgresql/pages/phase-6-aggregation/ordered-set/mode-and-booleans.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "rank/dense_rank/percent_rank/cume_dist WITHIN GROUP rank a value that is not in the set. Arguments must match ORDER BY columns. Inverse of percentile_cont: value\u2192fraction vs fraction\u2192value. rank(150) measured 66721 / 0.1334."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_6_aggregation_ordered_set_mode_and_booleans_mode", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_postgresql_pages_phase_6_aggregation_ord